3) City Weather App
Link: https://cityweather.lovable.app/
-The City Weather App is a responsive web application that provides users with real-time weather information for any city worldwide. The application allows users to search for a city by name and instantly view key weather details such as temperature, weather conditions, humidity, and wind information in a clean and user-friendly interface.
-The project focuses on delivering a smooth user experience with a minimal and modern design. It demonstrates effective integration of external weather APIs, dynamic data rendering, and error handling for invalid or unavailable city searches. The application is optimized for different screen sizes, making it accessible on mobile, tablet, and desktop devices.
